{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t石鼓洲旁人工島綜合廢物管理設施第1期發生三級火，暫未接獲受傷報告。消防人員正進行滅火行動。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n消防處表示，​如市民受到隨風飄散的煙霧和異味影響，請關閉門窗及保持鎮定。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:20:48.307780+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:50:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:38:40.112636+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:18:26.125055+00:00","content_hash":"5288056682962826f2f6d37da8c5b460c87e09d09bba70dead804496f291a482","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}